<!--
  Status-bar notification icon.

  Android renders the small icon as a monochrome silhouette: it keeps only the
  alpha channel and tints the shape with the notification colour. A full-colour
  launcher icon therefore shows up as a solid white square. This drawable is a
  white-on-transparent bell so it renders correctly on every Android version.

  Referenced by:
    - AndroidManifest.xml  -> com.google.firebase.messaging.default_notification_icon
    - pushService.ts       -> notifee displayNotification android.smallIcon
    - backend .env         -> FIREBASE_ANDROID_ICON (android.notification.icon)
-->
